{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-09-28 16:30:00', 'title': 'LENNAR CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': "MIAMI , SEPT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LENNAR CORPORATION (NYSE: LEN AND LEN.B), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HOMEBUILDERS, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.375 PER SHARE FOR BOTH CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 27, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 13, 2022."}